# Controls what `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads to Cloud Build.
#
# Deliberately NOT just a copy of .gitignore: with no .gcloudignore present,
# gcloud silently falls back to .gitignore to decide what to upload — which
# excludes data/vayu_deploy.duckdb (correctly, it's a 247MB generated
# artifact that has no business in git history) and so also silently excluded
# it from the deploy upload, failing the build at the `COPY
# data/vayu_deploy.duckdb` step with "file not found in build context" -
# found by testing, not by reading the code. This file exists specifically so
# that exclusion does not carry over: everything below is training-only or
# local-dev-only weight the deployed image never needs, and nothing below
# touches the actual deploy database.
.git
.gitignore
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
node_modules
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/.next
data/cache
data/dossiers
data/vayu.duckdb
data/vayu.duckdb.wal
data/samples
.env
secrets/
*.log
tests
_archive_not_in_repo/
.DS_Store
